# .assetsignore is a safety net, not the primary mechanism.
#
# Paths here are resolved against the Pages output directory (`dist`, set in
# wrangler.toml) — NOT the repo root. scripts/build.js already produces a dist/
# containing only the six files the site needs, so normally nothing here matches.
# These patterns only bite if someone points pages_build_output_dir back at ".".

node_modules
tests
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.toml
.gitignore
.github
*.log
